<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-18T04:37:01.196Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 04:37:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese Armed Forces have taken Al-Khuwai and five other sites in West Kordofan and are moving toward Al-Nahud while reinforcing the Blue Nile front, increasing pressure on the Rapid Support Forces. The RSF continues to conduct drone strikes on civilian populations and power stations, causing darkness and civilian casualties, including children, and the UN reports that drones account for nearly three-quarters of Sudan war deaths this year. A former Sudanese information minister was attacked in Uganda, and a former Sudanese official wanted by the ICC was arrested, confirming U.S. involvement. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/fresh-clashes-at-the-eritrean-border-is-ethiopia-sliding-into-a-regional-war/a-79970353?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Amnesty International&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Australian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQS1BwWlhPbFRzbl9YdGJKSzBUUm5WR0dpdE1ZcUJLUDNLUUl5UG1pbk8tMy1vbHRrUGsyaFZaY2tTM0x0ZFpUU21zckVyZmFwM0pTY3RHZHdrSDUtX1FxWTV5V2k3cVZOSzhHSGNHcFFuWDBaakIzRnZpTGNRSEdGSGl2aUtRQmdseVhUZEZqdnlEeE5QWHl5QmtrVFdvQ0lyRFdWRVkya3RMbVhWdzJVcUtieDBhNlh0TXJkc1JB?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPZ2h0eExVOG5Ja1VVckE4d092NEJqV0NDQkdGSGRzanYyZ21HOHluRThVNDR4V2h6S3gzM2pwSTBKZXF0SWVWRS1NQXpYcE1XNnp6cE1sdXMtZU16LTFWVkU5ZFpSbEhXUjNWc2xRc3hLNlNrZFZEcEdyQk04QTBqTnB2S1FadEplR3VZZ2hkSEZxXzRKMk91Y3lTUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;h